<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>🧟Zombies</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>

<body class="zombies-page">
    <%- include('./partials/navbar') %>

        <div class="cards">

            <div class="runner-card">
                <h2>Runner</h2>
                <p>The first and weakest stage of zombies after contact with the Cordyceps brain infection. Their
                    attacks are speedy and clumsy, and their tendency to swarm their targets.</p>
                <div class="danger-level">
                    <span>DANGER LEVEL</span>
                    <strong>1</strong>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="stalker-card">
                <h2>Stalker</h2>
                <p>The second stage. They take between two weeks and one year to reach this stage after exposure to the
                    Cordyceps brain infection.</p>
                <div class="danger-level">
                    <span>DANGER LEVEL</span>
                    <strong>2</strong>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="clicker-card">
                <h2>Clicker</h2>
                <p>The third stage. A year of prolonged exposure to the fungus, gives them strength that significantly
                    surpasses the average human, and use echolocation to see.</p>
                <div class="danger-level">
                    <span>DANGER LEVEL</span>
                    <strong>3</strong>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="shambler-card">
                <h2>Shambler</h2>
                <p>The fourth stage. Believed to have developed from exposure to high amounts of water, spray gaseous
                    acid when they get near, slow but sprint if noise alerts them.</p>
                <div class="danger-level">
                    <span>DANGER LEVEL</span>
                    <strong>4</strong>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="bloater-card">
                <h2>Bloater</h2>
                <p>Bloaters are the fifth, rarest, and one of the most aggressive stages of zombies. They are covered in
                    thick fungus that acts as armor plates, and can 'see' using echolocation. </p>
                <div class="danger-level">
                    <span>DANGER LEVEL</span>
                    <strong>5</strong>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="rat-king-card">
                <h2>Rat King</h2>
                <p>A super-organism composed of multiple stalkers, clickers, and a bloater that have been connected
                    together by fungus. The rat king possesses incredible strength and resilience, and capable of taking
                    extensive damage before dying.</p>
                <div class="danger-level">
                    <span>DANGER LEVEL</span>
                    <strong>6</strong>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
</body>

</html>